=== Demo: pre-commit hooks for offline Tier 1 skill checks ===
scratch: /tmp/precommit-hooks-demo
hook repo: /workspace

$ git init -b main
Initialized empty Git repository in /tmp/precommit-hooks-demo/.git/
exit: 0

$ git config user.name Matt Van Horn
exit: 0

$ git config user.email mvanhorn@users.noreply.github.com
exit: 0

$ git add skills .pre-commit-config.yaml
exit: 0

# Run the shipped hooks against the starter skill

$ pre-commit try-repo /workspace --all-files --verbose
[INFO] Initializing environment for ../../workspace.
